        "text_fZXk32WhaHZnG3GL-1": "<p>No food, no water, no c#iarette or vape for 12+ hours. Respect. Lio keeps your hands busy and your mind off the clock so the afternoon doesn&apos;t feel like forever.</p>",
        "text_iOJr9huiVkTbuj3h-1": "<p>.2</p>",
        "text_WuTcF6wlXk7DuQ0b-1": "<p>It&apos;s the same feeling, just without the nicotine</p>",
        "text_hFyGHTHAzDNBtilr-1": "<p>Honestly? What you miss most during the fast isn&apos;t even the nicotine. It&apos;s the motion. The reach, the hold, the exhale. That little moment of calm. Lio gives you exactly that. Nothing less, nothing more,</p>",
        "text_Qo4CplnfdFjtmoRv-1": "<p>.3</p>",
        "text_UaiJJ7JlCdTUsDBO-1": "<p>No smoke, no vapor, no smell, nobody has to know</p>",
        "text_GnkAXugZZICDxvj9-1": "<p>Use it in the car, at the office, wherever. It&apos;s completely discreet. No clouds, no smell on your clothes, no questions. Just you and your vibe.</p>",
        "text_db9rjOV4OYBIAn2H-1": "<p>.4</p>",
        "text_ngNV6ug5hZn6AkXy-1": "<p>You&apos;re still sm#king after Iftar, this just makes the day easier</p>",
        "text_EXzcxO5mIX76VTrq-1": "<p>Let&apos;s be real, nobody said you have to quit. Lio is just there for the hours between Fajr and Maghrib. Get through the day comfortably, then enjoy your evening exactly how you like it.</p>",
        "text_iDT4AoDTq2y9Ujvz-1": "<p>.5</p>",
        "text_wPsylpF1wzrxgLxc-1": "<p><strong>5. Ramadan is 30 days,  might as well make them easy on yourself</strong></p>",
        "text_o8kdclfEj2p3wV6f-1": "<p>The month is already about patience and discipline. You don&apos;t need to add unnecessary suffering on top of that. Lio takes the edge off so you can actually be present, enjoy the iftar table, and make the most of the month.</p>",
